{
    "swagger": "2.0",
    "info": {
        "description": "本地 HTTP 打印接口:提交 JSON 排版打印任务、查询已注册打印机。同一请求模型将来供 MQTT 复用。",
        "title": "聪明付 打印服务 API",
        "contact": {},
        "version": "1.0"
    },
    "basePath": "/",
    "paths": {
        "/api/print": {
            "post": {
                "description": "body 可为单个对象(打一台)或对象数组(一次打多台,各自目标/contents/参数,并发执行、失败隔离)。\n目标二选一:printer(字符串=名/ID,或对象 {name,ip,brand,width})或 gateway(网口 IP 或 \"usb\")。\n目标未注册且带了 IP(printer.ip 或 gateway)→ 随打印自动登记入库(建列表);没带名字则用 IP 当名字。\ncloud authoritative:下发的 buzzer/cut/retry/headLines/tailLines 与 printer 身份(name/brand/width)会**覆盖并持久化**到目标打印机,属性页同步显示(每次打印都以云端为准)。\n必填字段(缺一即 400,无降级、不回退打印机默认):buzzer(0关1开)、cut(0关1开,控制打印后是否切纸)、retry(重试次数,0=不重试/N=失败重试N次)、headLines(0=默认)、tailLines(0=默认)。\n建议值:type=5(JSON 排版),pWidth=58/80,pCopy=1,buzzer=0,cut=1,retry=1,head/tailLines=0。\ncontents(type=5)元素:title / text(bold,size\"WH\",align) / div_line·div_star / 表格(thead+tbody) / both_sides / qrcode / bc128·code39 / png。切纸由顶层 cut 字段统一控制,contents 内无需 cut 元素(写了也会被忽略)。\n响应:成功 {\"ok\":true,\"jobNo\":N,\"message\":\"已提交\"};失败 {\"ok\":false,\"message\":\"原因\"}。数组请求返回逐台 PrintResponse 数组(逐台成功/失败)。\n常见错误码:400=JSON解析失败 / 缺少必填字段(buzzer·cut·retry·headLines·tailLines)/ buzzer·cut 只能为0或1 / retry 为负 / type 不支持(仅5或1)/ 渲染失败 / 未指定打印目标 / gateway=usb 但无已注册USB机;404=printer 名/ID 未找到;405=非 POST。",
                "consumes": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "print"
                ],
                "summary": "提交打印任务(支持一次多台)",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "description": "打印请求(单对象;数组请直接传 JSON 数组)",
                        "name": "request",
                        "in": "body",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintRequest"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "已提交 {ok:true,jobNo:123};数组返回逐台数组",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "参数错误:JSON解析失败 / 缺少必填字段 / buzzer·cut 非0/1 / retry为负 / type不支持 / 渲染失败 / 未指定打印目标",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "未找到打印机:printer 名/ID 不存在",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "405": {
                        "description": "仅支持 POST",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/printers": {
            "get": {
                "description": "GET:列出已注册打印机(返回 PrinterInfo 数组)。\nPOST:云端下发打印机清单(PrinterSync 数组),按身份(网口=IP,USB=usbName)增量 upsert——有则只更新展示字段、无则新建(替代手动创建);不传 brand→其他,不传 width→80;返回同步后的完整列表。\n常见错误码:400=POST body 不是打印机数组 / JSON 解析失败;405=非 GET/POST。",
                "consumes": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "print"
                ],
                "summary": "列出 / 同步打印机",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "description": "打印机清单(仅 POST)",
                        "name": "request",
                        "in": "body",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                                "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrinterSync"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "打印机列表(GET 现有;POST 同步后)",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                                "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrinterInfo"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "POST body 应为打印机数组 / JSON 解析失败",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "405": {
                        "description": "仅支持 GET/POST",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "post": {
                "description": "GET:列出已注册打印机(返回 PrinterInfo 数组)。\nPOST:云端下发打印机清单(PrinterSync 数组),按身份(网口=IP,USB=usbName)增量 upsert——有则只更新展示字段、无则新建(替代手动创建);不传 brand→其他,不传 width→80;返回同步后的完整列表。\n常见错误码:400=POST body 不是打印机数组 / JSON 解析失败;405=非 GET/POST。",
                "consumes": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "print"
                ],
                "summary": "列出 / 同步打印机",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "description": "打印机清单(仅 POST)",
                        "name": "request",
                        "in": "body",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                                "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrinterSync"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "打印机列表(GET 现有;POST 同步后)",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                                "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrinterInfo"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "POST body 应为打印机数组 / JSON 解析失败",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    },
                    "405": {
                        "description": "仅支持 GET/POST",
                        "schema": {
                            "$ref": "#/definitions/api.PrintResponse"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "definitions": {
        "api.PrintRequest": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "buzzer": {
                    "description": "蜂鸣:0=关 1=开(必填)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 0
                },
                "contents": {
                    "description": "打印内容:type=5 为排版元素数组;type=1 为 base64 字符串。",
                    "type": "object"
                },
                "cut": {
                    "description": "切刀:0=关 1=开(必填)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 1
                },
                "gateway": {
                    "description": "打印目标网关(与 printer 二选一):网口 IP(如 \"192.168.0.89\",未注册则按 IP 自动登记入库)或 \"usb\"(首台 USB 机)。",
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "192.168.0.89"
                },
                "headLines": {
                    "description": "首部空行:0=默认(必填)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 0
                },
                "id": {
                    "description": "任务 ID:用于防重打(同 id 只打一次)。建议每单唯一;0 表示不防重。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 1001
                },
                "pCopy": {
                    "description": "份数(可选,默认 1)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 1
                },
                "pWidth": {
                    "description": "纸宽 mm:58 或 80(可选,默认按打印机设置)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 80
                },
                "printer": {
                    "description": "打印目标(与 gateway 二选一):字符串=打印机名/ID;对象={name,ip,brand,width},未注册则自动登记入库。",
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "飞蛾1"
                },
                "retry": {
                    "description": "重试次数:0=不重试,N=失败重试 N 次(必填)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 1
                },
                "tailLines": {
                    "description": "尾部空行:0=默认(必填)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 0
                },
                "type": {
                    "description": "排版类型:5=JSON 排版(建议),1=ESC 原始指令(base64 字符串)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 5
                }
            }
        },
        "api.PrintResponse": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "jobNo": {
                    "type": "integer"
                },
                "message": {
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "ok": {
                    "type": "boolean"
                }
            }
        },
        "api.PrinterInfo": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "addr": {
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "brand": {
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "conn": {
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "id": {
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "width": {
                    "type": "integer"
                }
            }
        },
        "api.PrinterSync": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
                "brand": {
                    "description": "品牌/型号(可选,缺省→其他):佳博 / 飞蛾 / 其他。",
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "佳博"
                },
                "conn": {
                    "description": "连接方式:\"ip\"/\"network\"=网口,\"usb\"=USB(默认网口)。",
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "ip"
                },
                "ip": {
                    "description": "网口 IP(conn=ip 必填,作为身份匹配键)。",
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "192.168.0.89"
                },
                "name": {
                    "description": "名称(可选;缺省用 IP/USB 名)。",
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "厨房-01"
                },
                "port": {
                    "description": "网口端口(可选,默认 9100)。",
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "9100"
                },
                "usbName": {
                    "description": "USB 设备名(conn=usb 必填,作为身份匹配键)。",
                    "type": "string"
                },
                "width": {
                    "description": "纸宽 mm:58 或 80(可选,默认 80)。",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "example": 80
                }
            }
        }
    }
}